Hey guys, this video shows that this API is working in order to have treasury swaps within DAOs on Cardano. There is not a public github link to this API because as mentioned in the proposals this proposal is not open source (https://projectcatalyst.io/funds/10/daos-cardano/clarity-dao-treasury-defi-integrations). We have released and revealed this API to our developers which you can see working in the demo video which satisfies this milestone.
Happy to finally get this proposal finished. This video shows that this API is working in order to have treasury swaps within DAOs on Cardano. (https://projectcatalyst.io/funds/10/daos-cardano/clarity-dao-treasury-defi-integrations).
We have released and revealed this API to our developers which you can see working in the demo video. We can invite you to the repo for you to check it out.
The milestone’s purpose is to expose an API that our developers can use which has clearly happened since it is being used in the app.
For this PoA we have developed and implemented the necessary APIs and endpoints to enable seamless integration with the front-end interface. The milestone is accomplished through a usable endpoint to accomplish an automatically executing treasury swap after a DAO vote.
We have tested and validated the API functionality and ensured compatibility with the existing Clarity Protocol infrastructure. You can see the video as proof!
We have included the API documentation below as well!
Demo video of the treasury swap feature: https://youtu.be/l87-_b0_UFo?si=2fDrovNoF0YZdPZr
API Documentation:
declare function createProposal(url: string, wallet: Wallet, request: CreateProposal): Promise<CreateProposalResult>;
type CreateProposalResult = {
 submitResult: TransactionSubmitResult;
 id: ProposalId;
};
type CreateProposal = {
 user: User;
 dao: Dao;
 governor: GyTxOutRef;
 stake: GyTxOutRef;
 outcomes: Array<Outcome>;
};
type GyTxOutRef = string;
type Outcome = Array<Effect>;
type Effect = EffectGovernorMutation | EffectTre
